                "loc": "GEN.22.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 22:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomooni nukwo kutandika kwombeka Enju ya MUKAMA, Yerusaalemu. Ha rusozi Moliya, MUKAMA nambere yabonekeriire Daudi ise, omu kiikaro Daudi eki akaba akomere, ha rubuga orwaahulirwahoga orw'Orunaani Omuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukwezi okwa kabiri okw'omwaka ogwa kana ogw'engoma ye, nubwo yatandikire kwombeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju Solomooni ei yayombekiire Ruhanga, akagirenga ati: Oburaiha obw'orulengo orw'okubanza obw'orulengo orukuru zikaba ziri mita nkaaga, kandi obugazi mita makumi abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekisasi ky'omulyango ekikaba kiri omumaiso g'ekicweka ekya hagati eky'enju, oburaiha zikaba ziri mita makumi abiri, nikingana n'obugazi; kandi obwemi bwakyo, mita kikumi mu abiri. Omunda akagisiiga ezaabbu enungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekicweka ekya hagati, akakyaliira n'emisambya, yakisiiga ezaabbu, yakisaruraho emikindo n'emikuufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagikunisa n'amabaale ag'omuhendo. Ezaabbu egi, niyo eyarugaga Paruvaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju, nukwo kugisiiga ezaabbu, emirabba yayo, ebiti by'emiryango, ebisiika n'enyigi; ha bisiika, yasaruraho ebisisani bya bakerubbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
